From 15991e06b04e144464a0fe7a18d70efb4e1cfc37 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian Hewitt <christianshewitt@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 18:28:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 272/280] WIP: media: rkvdec: vdpu381: add AFBC capture formats

4K decode on VDPU346 and VDPU381 is limited by memory bandwidth, and
the decoder writes and reads its frames uncompressed. It can instead
write AFBC frames and read AFBC references.

Offer the YUV 4:2:0 AFBC formats for H.264, HEVC and VP9, after the
linear formats, or ahead of them when the afbc module parameter is set.
Size the buffers and program the header stride and payload offset as
the vendor stack does, report the 4-line picture offset of H.264 and
HEVC frames as the capture compose rectangle, and keep field and MBAFF
H.264 streams on the linear formats, which the decoder cannot compress.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Christian Hewitt <christianshewitt@gmail.com>
